{% doc %}
  The site's icons, for browser tabs, bookmarks, search results and home screens (DS-189): the
  Gallery's simple stacked colour box logo on every page, whatever the programme, since the site
  is the Gallery's. Built by design-system/scripts/build_favicon.py (DESIGN.md §8.1) and copied
  into assets by sync_theme.py; not a theme setting, as the logos aren't.

  - The SVG is for browsers that draw one. The 32 px PNG, with its size given, is for the others,
    and the SVG comes after it so browsers that read both choose it.
  - The home screen icon is the logo on white, 180 px, as iOS expects; Android reads it too.

  @example
  {%- render 'gs-favicon' -%}
{% enddoc %}
<link rel="icon" href="{{ 'gs-favicon-32.png' | asset_url }}" sizes="32x32" type="image/png">
<link rel="icon" href="{{ 'gs-favicon.svg' | asset_url }}" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="{{ 'gs-apple-touch-icon.png' | asset_url }}">
